 154:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_iwdg.c ****  [..]  This section provides functions allowing to:
 155:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_iwdg.c ****       (+) Initialize the IWDG according to the specified parameters in the
 156:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_iwdg.c ****           IWDG_InitTypeDef of associated handle.
 157:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_iwdg.c ****       (+) Manage Window option.
 158:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_iwdg.c ****       (+) Once initialization is performed in HAL_IWDG_Init function, Watchdog
 159:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_iwdg.c ****           is reloaded in order to exit function with correct time base.
 160:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_iwdg.c **** 
 161:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_iwdg.c **** @endverbatim
 162:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_iwdg.c ****   * @{
 163:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_iwdg.c ****   */
