 168:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_iwdg.c ****   *         watchdog is refreshed in order to have correct time base.
 169:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_iwdg.c ****   * @param  hiwdg  pointer to a IWDG_HandleTypeDef structure that contains
